\item{\code{\link[=nutrigon_coefs]{nutrigon_coefs()}}}{Extract the fitted link-scale quadratic
coefficients from a fit, regardless of model type.}
\item{\code{\link[=nutrigon_elongation]{nutrigon_elongation()}}}{Estimate the curvature elongation ratio
